{"seq":3,"slug":"memory-and-register","title":"内存与寄存器管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/embedded-fundamentals/memory-and-register","wordCount":896,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"内存与寄存器管理\">内存与寄存器管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>嵌入式系统的内存资源极度受限——典型 MCU 只有几十 KB 的 SRAM 和几百 KB 的 Flash。在这种约束下，理解内存布局、链接脚本、栈与堆的管理方式，以及寄存器级编程技巧，是写出可靠嵌入式代码的基础。与通用计算不同，嵌入式开发中的内存错误（栈溢出、内存碎片、未初始化访问）往往导致系统崩溃或不可预测的行为，且极难调试。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[MCU 内存布局] --&gt; B[Flash 程序区]&#10;    A --&gt; C[SRAM 数据区]&#10;    B --&gt; D[中断向量表]&#10;    B --&gt; E[.text 代码段]&#10;    B --&gt; F[.rodata 只读数据]&#10;    C --&gt; G[.data 已初始化变量]&#10;    C --&gt; H[.bss 零初始化变量]&#10;    C --&gt; I[Heap 堆]&#10;    C --&gt; J[Stack 栈]&#10;    J --&gt; K[MSP 主栈指针]&#10;    J --&gt; L[PSP 进程栈指针]\">graph TD\n    A[MCU 内存布局] --&gt; B[Flash 程序区]\n    A --&gt; C[SRAM 数据区]\n    B --&gt; D[中断向量表]\n    B --&gt; E[.text 代码段]\n    B --&gt; F[.rodata 只读数据]\n    C --&gt; G[.data 已初始化变量]\n    C --&gt; H[.bss 零初始化变量]\n    C --&gt; I[Heap 堆]\n    C --&gt; J[Stack 栈]\n    J --&gt; K[MSP 主栈指针]\n    J --&gt; L[PSP 进程栈指针]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内存区域</th>\n<th>存储介质</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>存储内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>.text</td>\n<td>Flash</td>\n<td>只读，上电保持</td>\n<td>代码指令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.rodata</td>\n<td>Flash</td>\n<td>只读</td>\n<td>常量字符串、const 数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.data</td>\n<td>SRAM（Flash 初始值）</td>\n<td>读写</td>\n<td>已初始化的全局/静态变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.bss</td>\n<td>SRAM</td>\n<td>读写，启动时清零</td>\n<td>未初始化的全局/静态变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stack</td>\n<td>SRAM</td>\n<td>LIFO，向下增长</td>\n<td>局部变量、函数调用帧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Heap</td>\n<td>SRAM</td>\n<td>动态分配</td>\n<td>malloc/free 分配的内存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"链接脚本与内存映射\">链接脚本与内存映射</h2><p>链接脚本（Linker Script）定义了代码和数据在 MCU 内存中的布局。理解链接脚本是控制内存分配的关键：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"/* STM32F411 链接脚本片段 */&#10;MEMORY&#10;{&#10;    FLASH (rx)  : ORIGIN = 0x08000000, LENGTH = 512K&#10;    SRAM  (rwx) : ORIGIN = 0x20000000, LENGTH = 128K&#10;}&#10;&#10;SECTIONS&#10;{&#10;    .isr_vector : {&#10;        KEEP(*(.isr_vector))&#10;    } &gt; FLASH&#10;&#10;    .text : {&#10;        *(.text*)&#10;        *(.rodata*)&#10;    } &gt; FLASH&#10;&#10;    .data : {&#10;        _sdata = .;&#10;        *(.data*)&#10;        _edata = .;&#10;    } &gt; SRAM AT &gt; FLASH&#10;&#10;    .bss : {&#10;        _sbss = .;&#10;        *(.bss*)&#10;        *(COMMON)&#10;        _ebss = .;&#10;    } &gt; SRAM&#10;&#10;    /* 栈放在 SRAM 顶部 */&#10;    _estack = ORIGIN(SRAM) + LENGTH(SRAM);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* STM32F411 链接脚本片段 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">MEMORY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    FLASH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (rx)  : ORIGIN </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">08000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, LENGTH </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#B31D28;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#FDAEB7;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> 512K</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    SRAM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (rwx) : ORIGIN </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, LENGTH </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#B31D28;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#FDAEB7;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> 128K</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SECTIONS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .isr_vector : {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        KEEP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.isr_vector))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FLASH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .text : {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.rodata</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FLASH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .data : {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        _sdata </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        _edata </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SRAM AT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FLASH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .bss : {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        _sbss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.bss</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(COMMON)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        _ebss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SRAM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    /* 栈放在 SRAM 顶部 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    _estack </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ORIGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(SRAM) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LENGTH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(SRAM);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>启动代码</strong>负责在 main() 之前完成内存初始化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"void Reset_Handler(void) {&#10;    /* 从 Flash 复制 .data 到 SRAM */&#10;    uint32_t *src = &amp;_sidata;&#10;    uint32_t *dst = &amp;_sdata;&#10;    while (dst &lt; &amp;_edata) {&#10;        *dst++ = *src++;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    /* 清零 .bss */&#10;    dst = &amp;_sbss;&#10;    while (dst &lt; &amp;_ebss) {&#10;        *dst++ = 0;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    /* 调用 C++ 静态构造函数（如果有）*/&#10;    __libc_init_array();&#10;&#10;    main();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Reset_Handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    /* 从 Flash 复制 .data 到 SRAM */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">src </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">_sidata;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dst </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">_sdata;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dst </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">_edata) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dst</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">src</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    /* 清零 .bss */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dst </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">_sbss;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dst </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">_ebss) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dst</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    /* 调用 C++ 静态构造函数（如果有）*/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    __libc_init_array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"栈管理与溢出检测\">栈管理与溢出检测</h2><p>栈溢出是嵌入式系统最危险的内存问题之一——栈向下增长覆盖 .bss 或 .data 区域，导致不可预测的行为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"/* 静态栈大小分析：计算最深调用链 */&#10;// main() → processData() → parsePacket() → checkCRC()&#10;//  每个函数栈帧：局部变量 + 保存的寄存器 + 对齐&#10;//  加上最深中断嵌套的栈消耗&#10;&#10;/* 运行时栈检测方法1：填充模式 */&#10;#define STACK_CANARY 0xDEADBEEF&#10;void stack_init(void) {&#10;    extern uint32_t _sstack;&#10;    extern uint32_t _estack;&#10;    uint32_t *p = &amp;_sstack;&#10;    while (p &lt; &amp;_estack - 256) {&#10;        *p++ = STACK_CANARY;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;uint32_t stack_usage(void) {&#10;    extern uint32_t _sstack;&#10;    extern uint32_t _estack;&#10;    uint32_t *p = &amp;_sstack;&#10;    while (*p == STACK_CANARY) p++;&#10;    return (uint32_t)(&amp;_estack) - (uint32_t)p;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 运行时栈检测方法2：MPU 保护 */&#10;// 在栈底部设置一个不可访问的 MPU 区域&#10;// 栈溢出时触发 MemManage Fault\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 静态栈大小分析：计算最深调用链 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// main() → processData() → parsePacket() → checkCRC()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//  每个函数栈帧：局部变量 + 保存的寄存器 + 对齐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//  加上最深中断嵌套的栈消耗</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 运行时栈检测方法1：填充模式 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#define</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F